+		{Rules: []lifecycle.Rule{{Status: lifecycle.Enabled, Filter: lifecycle.Filter{Tag: lifecycle.Tag{Key: "environment", Value: "prod"}}, Expiration: lifecycle.Expiration{Days: 1}}}},
